QPMqMNASHVZ2qYmLF6TE92AjQpdfbQW2qUCCO4UtasjTI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPWEqTVz5RkZJGX2_9pWIUFo1x-WQsqt03cka38EYdS6Q&oe=6AE098D9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "officialtrailer (1).png", "id": "2685734508548045", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673536876_2685734511881378_3839269232491950372_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ne-CVrBWZvUQ7kNvwEoi-pg&_nc_oc=AdoIyJF-pJTXB4huyoZXnEf09FOAoQmJXxZDaGxUzIgdtwM6vrVYisKfKN4KzqbPNd8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOJsI0irZvgn-athHYd9ko_lu1b1pm9_jTBe0Ap1zTSSw&oe=6AE0C110"}, "display_name": "UluP Spatial", "keywords": ["produttivit\u00e0", "realt\u00e0mista", "progetti", "mani", "collaborazione"], "long_description": "UluP Spatial porta la mappa dei tuoi progetti UluP Spaces nella realt\u00e0 mista su Quest. Invece di una tela piatta su uno schermo, i nodi del tuo progetto fluttuano intorno a te come veri oggetti 3D che puoi afferrare, spostare e collegare con le tue mani.\n\n**Cosa puoi fare:**\n- Vedi i tuoi progetti e nodi reali, sincronizzati in tempo reale dal tuo account UluP Spaces\n- Afferra e riposiziona i nodi con hand tracking o controller\n- Apri un nodo per vedere e completare i task, aggiungine di nuovi a voce o con la tastiera virtuale\n- Disegna collegamenti tra i nodi per mappare come le tue idee si relazionano\n- Concentrati su un singolo task con note e un timer integrato\n- Visualizza allegati immagine e file direttamente nella scena\n- Lavora sullo stesso progetto insieme a un collaboratore, in tempo reale \u2014 vedi chi \u00e8 online e cosa sta facendo\n- Passa da AR (passthrough, la tua stanza reale) a VR completa\n\nUluP Spatial usa lo stesso account e gli stessi progetti di UluP Spaces (web/desktop) \u2014 niente da configurare due volte, niente di duplicato. Accedi e i tuoi progetti sono gi\u00e0 l\u00ec, incluse eventuali automazioni create con UluP SDK Studio (costruiscine una tu, o importa un template pronto dalla libreria della community \u2014 basta parlare con Claude per crearne una via MCP).", "short_description": "La mappa del tuo progetto, in realt\u00e0 mista. Afferra i nodi, collega le idee, gestisci i task con le mani \u2014 sincronizzata in tempo reale con il tuo account UluP Spaces."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "spatial-banner (1).png", "id": "2382445852525002", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825575_2382445855858335_7138643287115300965_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OikAnj_Ap9gQ7kNvwHrzfuT&_nc_oc=AdqXBHeQakK1fo9DOpPFsufoztUHo_NXRuCWOmGfzIDlEuYB2K4w4ScVBY5S_xWExz0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM9U0IgoYnznkwQ12wqdLLrwb7LqUYmQC12_9qPsBFpvg&oe=6AE09D7C"}, {"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE.png", "id": "1608104100808199", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_1608104107474865_7754736957045553453_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JCqIzHezbfgQ7kNvwHjX_iE&_nc_oc=AdpZDtkDwWeU_B372rznv7gjoEaqWOsiTz687OUCX6cyQFZS4B87RMQ-J12V8P15Pw4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMXMafAQczx7-oYaH7IIl-RqFu89cKU_aO4CC45XwBOWQ&oe=6AE0B801"}, {"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT.png", "id": "1593351859005122", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823310_1593351865671788_2270217285466024058_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1qHuPJYUxqwQ7kNvwHQAMZZ&_nc_oc=AdqsfJWCT8t82QRD2VPYtWSbQHDBkJO9lwceGZt7aCCJlS2t6NyYVJ9uDEOY4zjolm0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPeofmugdXCnT9lKW_qQskpi-u3FRC9vVWHGLRr6WrIUQ&oe=6AE095E5"}, {"file_name": "ulup-spatial-logo (1).png", "id": "1090972580309949", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825503_1090972583643282_4131135753565673900_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Gm4uJS0GC1gQ7kNvwHOJyAK&_nc_oc=Adp3z6yrVVgxBaMDsAjcRTIu8CrDegivz0RESD01tOXT47Z1OpD-Jvnl-zE3Pm-3-YI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPmPC6rDENvTYlOK_R2BWR_Ou_iTNvtJH5jZGwsPlyQIw&oe=6AE0C2DE"}, {"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE.png", "id": "1090636453800314", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823341_1090636457133647_6442307859406608571_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uaGkG7Hoyo4Q7kNvwGohMVe&_nc_oc=AdpMt28nE0dSGWir6KYAzL56M4fj226sM9Z7aCSyhOMZByLWkKdgJUOyPVyhf_Du-8Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNF9u6d3fNp9cN3DYQxNwrPKUOl1ks43ANagp7bhYDZAA&oe=6AE0A7A9"}]}, "id": "995602590224627", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_X6a0Oh3mYa_16x9.png", "id": "1677074717114370", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604347072_1677074720447703_5618519853673493455_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vNPd-B5zUhsQ7kNvwE4Lk7M&_nc_oc=Adqtgil68NCMJ0Tl2k-n_stoKDUyV4DVLxUaCpEFMwEbl-IqWVdTrmVWUgljbBA7jwc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPRY4x8esseM_0zU13u0zBCnO6Xsg98FqrsdPgR3ouoiA&oe=6AE09AF7"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_2JYnPdfHG9_16x9.png", "id": "1621134649514967", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830441_1621134652848300_1490796086755638049_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r0iPL5DS_bUQ7kNvwEVZqpb&_nc_oc=AdoFPfUAdCy4zF6gsTtQT4EvAQD0yx3c52lbN2mG0EbkjVPM0RtKgiDkOdzgSWOsk9w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPzT4fA9_DYodAian1rFDP1nK5ggD4qjJf9BHnh4KkuVg&oe=6AE0AA2D"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_w2gA8rmjnH_16x9.png", "id": "1076269148371312", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604385997_1076269155037978_773783658790453776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u_CzCEsjEDcQ7kNvwGL5t5U&_nc_oc=Adrl_JaXldYCrASPDAFLr3MuXceQDwRqtCQ0k-OFx9Bl4NNGwLEpbtUR1jfNXysgmYA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPDeQ38WWNga418EATvpx7Ut8HFvNss00EsF05BVEYjlg&oe=6AE0985F"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_WJg5wom5YU_16x9.png", "id": "1839101883739871", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673573223_1839101887073204_1369626186002792851_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b-Gtik_z9HsQ7kNvwHtOsAU&_nc_oc=AdqLXamKeFtOn7EIBL0y23MngT2iwdjmszdu9L7mCAy9MIYnLIPlfGwN-cV74w6vsNA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOwHK3wxRlI9HCySOgDGeWLA1KJrgtS8GdsMawbjyVtFg&oe=6AE0C4C4"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_ho5YNaQE9r_16x9 (1).png", "id": "1627886348715787", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_1627886352049120_8054576045411958904_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qFTBks9EswAQ7kNvwE3H8v8&_nc_oc=AdqVynyy__WGVje7wyY8UYejo_fqvHOlkHw9sgr7RN_dBT0K8B5rf3piEzN1fO98LJg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNgZ2F_sM8Ntlxg7ciGyJlYFEQA3Fkd_m6XJwoN33F4Mg&oe=6AE0B456"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "officialtrailer (1).png", "id": "1410773183811260", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596168449_1410773187144593_6502129704163225488_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PNxHv2BuEfcQ7kNvwFlmiBA&_nc_oc=AdpUXW3kfVS_HJW1O-cAOdGpcJqicwrN2Wj1oUqbM5o0OHA3FCS8j20MaTOuany2nt8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNjuHZPOQW4rW62BWd5igAEJUH1OuBrEwbeEKHCoL_b6Q&oe=6AE0A668"}, "display_name": "UluP Spatial", "keywords": ["productivity", "projects", "mixedreality", "handtracking", "collaboration"], "long_description": "UluP Spatial brings your UluP Spaces project map into mixed reality on Quest. Instead of a flat canvas on a screen, your project's nodes float around you as real 3D objects you grab, move and connect with your own hands.\n\n**What you can do:**\n- See your real projects and nodes, synced live from your UluP Spaces account\n- Grab and reposition nodes with hand tracking or controllers\n- Open a node to view and check off tasks, add new ones by voice or virtual keyboard\n- Draw connections between nodes to map how your ideas relate\n- Focus on a single task with notes and a built-in timer\n- View image and file attachments directly in the scene\n- Work on the same project together with a collaborator, in real time \u2014 see who's online and what they're working on\n- Switch between AR (passthrough, your real room) and full VR\n\nUluP Spatial uses the same account and the same projects as UluP Spaces (web/desktop) \u2014 nothing to set up twice, nothing duplicated. Sign in and your projects are already there, including any automation you've built with UluP SDK Studio (build one yourself, or import a ready-made one from the community template library \u2014 just talk to Claude to create one via MCP).", "short_description": "Your project map, in mixed reality. Grab nodes, connect ideas, manage tasks with your hands \u2014 synced live with your UluP Spaces account."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ulupstudio.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.ulupstudio.com/privacy", "publisher_name": "UluP Studio", "support_website_url": "https://www.ulupstudio.com/support", "website_url": "https://www.ulupstudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}, {"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": n